9
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:25,410
No!

10
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:26,050
Help!

11
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:26,940
Stop!

12
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,040
No!

13
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,260
No!

14
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:31,120
Stop!

15
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:31,920
Don't hurt me!

16
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:32,900
No!

17
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:41,860
Aah!

18
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:08,370
I'm sorry.

19
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:10,040
Help!

20
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,100
Help!

21
00:01:14,410 --> 00:01:15,850
Help me!

22
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,120
I don't want to die yet.

23
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:24,360
Ken.

24
00:01:26,210 --> 00:01:27,640
Help me!

25
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:32,500
